          "title": "You'll want to know: فساد",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "فساد — fasād — \"a riot; strife\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "شہر میں فساد ہوا۔ shahr meṅ fasād huā. There was a riot in the city."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "فساد (fasād) is usually traced, through Persian, to Arabic fasād, \"corruption, disorder\"; in Urdu it is most often violence between groups."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
